Goudy Old Style (URW)
=====================

Letterforms: Stanley Morison's Goudy Old Face (1924, The Goudy Press).
This digitization: URW Type Solutions, Inc. (1993), as shipped with
Microsoft Office (font data copyright Microsoft Corporation).

These files were extracted from a licensed Microsoft Office installation
on the deployment owner's machine and are served for this privately
served site, where the owner holds the usage rights. Do not
redistribute the font files without permission from the rights holders.
